    },
    {
      "text": "Heat olive oil in a large soup pot over medium-high heat; cook onion and garlic until soft, 2 to 3 minutes. Stir in kale and cook until wilted, about 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/XhYRaEK6UPh_WuyORbWCCN4xaqw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-132785-kale-soup-DDMFS-step-02-92ced60aab9a41d7918b761a24e4b09a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/132785/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in water, potatoes, beans, tomatoes, vegetable bouillon, parsley, and Italian seasoning.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ELQ8Tsu_Oy5zfB1ukD_jVka1l1o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-132785-kale-soup-DDMFS-step-03-eb4227b4167c43c385432c37b8541fde.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/132785/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bring to a boil, then reduce heat and simmer until potatoes are cooked through, about 25 minutes. Season with salt and pepper.",
